Guests }-- EntranceExams
Guests }-- Users
Guests }-- Classes
RevisionRegistrations }-- RevisionPackages
RevisionRegistrations }-- Classes
ClassSchedules }-- Classes
ClassSessions }-- ClassSchedules
ClassSessions }-- Rooms
ClassSessions }-- Users : Instructor
ContactMessages }-- Centers
PageImages }-- PageContents

@enduml
